Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.81,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.75,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't wanna live ordinary lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.75,0:01:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonderland.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:57.49,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(984,937)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(942,984,\1a&H00&)\t(6573,6615,\1a&HFF&)}Adventure on Little Garden
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:57.49,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(984,937)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Adventure on Little Garden
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.43,0:02:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, the snow, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow in this climate? Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.09,0:02:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Already happened once You just\Nmissed it because you were asleep
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.67,0:02:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's going to snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't rule anything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.95,0:02:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the sea you were in the\Nfirst time it snowed was special.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seven magnetic fields\Nthat emit from Reverse
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountain tend to make\Nthings particularly chaotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean you should relax\Nyour guard while sailing these waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.55,0:02:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The odds of it being as wild as\Nyour first journey may be small.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.77,0:02:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, these waters aren't normal and are\Ncertain to hold surprises of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, never underestimate the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.61,0:02:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.43,0:02:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone care to sample my special drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys want to\Nget out the fishing gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.99,0:03:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.90,0:03:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even make you one of\Nmy custom fishing rods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.19,0:03:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, somebody's sure thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.09,0:03:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have another.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.37,0:03:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, give him another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're acting like idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.91,0:03:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These boys may go through\Ntheir goofy phases,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but when things get\Nrough, they get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.71,0:03:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't know what's wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.65,0:03:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting worked up over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship will put you at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.09,0:03:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll cheer up in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attaboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.93,0:04:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, it's a dolphin,\Npirate's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.37,0:04:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.11,0:04:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's humongous!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:04:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.29,0:05:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that side. Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.41,0:05:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, hurry. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.01,0:05:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, which direction now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.11,0:05:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a second. I'll check.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Port side, fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turning fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cactus Island and this one here are\Ndefinitely pulling against each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.99,0:06:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our next stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it, our second\Nisland in the Grand Line?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.57,0:06:50.62,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,2067)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,75)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\t(1983,2484,\1a&HFF&)}{Kyuka}Vacation Island\NThe Grand Line
Dialogue: 2,0:06:46.57,0:06:50.62,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,2067)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,75)\3c&HFAFAFB&\c&HFAFAFB&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\t(1983,2484,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}{Kyuka}Vacation Island\NThe Grand Line
Dialogue: 3,0:06:46.57,0:06:50.62,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,2067)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,75)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}{Kyuka}Vacation Island\NThe Grand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:06:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Three?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:06:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, my dear, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing quite like\Nthe rich aroma of Earl Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.49,0:07:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the one hand, you say you're bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the other, you don't\Nlike working, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.69,0:07:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you cease your complaining?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.77,0:07:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And revel in the enjoyment of\Nthis rare slice of freedom,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some circumstances have\Ngenerously afforded you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.77,0:07:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How grand to be able to\Ntake a long vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A privilege few officers\Never get to indulge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.81,0:07:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.27,0:07:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would appreciate your\Nmindful and immediate
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.32,0:07:31.87,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,482)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,450)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)\t(5068,5109,\1a&HFF&)}Mr. 3\NOfficer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.32,0:07:31.87,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,482)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,450)\3c&HFAFAFB&\c&HFAFAFB&\1a&HFF&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)\t(5068,5109,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Mr. 3\NOfficer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 3,0:07:26.32,0:07:31.87,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,482)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,450)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}Mr. 3\NOfficer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,discretion in not calling\Nme by my codename in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.25,0:07:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, people will\Ndiscover that I am indeed Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.29,0:07:41.50,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,75)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)}Miss Golden Week\NOfficer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 2,0:07:38.29,0:07:41.50,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,75)\3c&HFAFAFB&\c&HFAFAFB&\1a&HFF&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Miss Golden Week\NOfficer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 3,0:07:38.29,0:07:41.50,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,75)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}Miss Golden Week\NOfficer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.57,0:07:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incidentally,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help noticing\Nyou've been perusing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.37,0:07:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that piece of paper over\Nthe last several days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.81,0:07:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does it grab you so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.45,0:07:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an order from boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.63,0:07:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five has been taken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone had to be terminated, I wish it\Nwould have been someone useless like Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.03,0:08:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.94,0:08:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what would benefit\Nyou with a fat promotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.85,0:08:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.53,0:08:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rather, the downfall of Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.79,0:08:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five is hardly exciting news at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.87,0:08:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man excelled at\Nnothing but his own idiocy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clinging to his Devil Fruit\Npower like a drowning rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.27,0:08:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are correct that a modicum\Nof my indifference stems
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the fact that Five's\Nmisfortune brings me no gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we may learn is power means\Nnothing if not properly harnessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.73,0:08:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Superior criminals are those who execute\Ntheir crimes using superior intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, whoever beat Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five should be made an example of,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If for no other reason than to\Npreserve the reputation of terror,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.57,0:08:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our organization is\Npainstakingly cultivated,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.19,0:08:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and indeed for criminality as a whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see why they call\Nthis place Little Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's little about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this island looks\Npretty harsh if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.43,0:09:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the cute name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks like a jungle out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'd be better\Noff skipping this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.19,0:09:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.10,0:09:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help but remember the\Nwarning Miss All Sunday gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.19,0:09:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.27,0:09:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might be attacked by\Ngiant monsters? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.77,0:09:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm sure we can make it to the next\Nisland without going ashore on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.43,0:09:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to reset\Nthe log is to go ashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention we're in dire need\Nof restocking our food supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.45,0:09:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't get so much as a\Nsack of flour in the last town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.29,0:09:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, there's our ticket in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.53,0:09:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think they'll have a\Nbarbecue restaurant here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't travel all\Nthis way for barbecue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the point of\Nthis visit was to get food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Food, as in supplies\Nwe're going to cook later?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.11,0:09:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.75,0:09:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oofsop might be right about this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.41,0:10:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take a look at the\Ngargantuan plant life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.15,0:10:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything\Nlike it, not even in books.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.05,0:10:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you. That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was talking to Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that screeching?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfectly harmless, just like this jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.37,0:10:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.05,0:10:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.11,0:10:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's the matter\Nwith you, you damn bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.09,0:10:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's big. Could be tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the kind of noise you\Nexpect to hear in a normal jungle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.91,0:10:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounded like a volcano erupting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.29,0:10:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gigantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.45,0:11:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.25,0:11:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is definitely not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone explain to me how a mammoth tiger\Ncan just keel over covered in blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long bows and food, be damned!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not stepping foot on\Nthat island and that's final!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.25,0:11:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can still reset the\Nreadings on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.69,0:11:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just sit tight until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.99,0:11:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When that's done, we'll\Nleave and never look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.93,0:11:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll all just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.53,0:11:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, go make lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.19,0:12:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, and one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it a great big pirate lunch\Nwith lots of meat and no veggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.55,0:12:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need some more energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Energy for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.47,0:12:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not leaving here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beast, do you want to come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too enthusiastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.37,0:12:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somewhere out there is a monster big\Nenough to grind a tiger into base.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.53,0:12:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji! I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'll have it to you as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.51,0:12:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Luffy, would it be all\Nright if I come along with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.05,0:12:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, sounds great. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe, you can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.95,0:12:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd rather not sit here with\Nnothing to do but worry about my troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will keep me busy\Ntill the logs reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the question, seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way too dangerous for you out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.31,0:12:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'll have Karoo with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:12:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo doesn't look too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.65,0:13:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might be in shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.89,0:13:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, if you go exploring,\Nyou'll need to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.87,0:13:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pack you a lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.01,0:13:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While you're at it, could\Nyou fix something for Karoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.25,0:13:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're all set and ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two pirate lunches for Luffy and\NVivi and a special drink for Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, see you guys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.91,0:13:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, what a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.13,0:13:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just what would you expect from someone\Nwho could infiltrate the enemy's ranks?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm bored. I'm gonna take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.35,0:14:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know we're kind of\Nshort on food, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you find any animals that\Nappear edible, bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could see why you'd want to send me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I could bring back something\Nyou couldn't catch yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.43,0:14:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.55,0:14:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let that remark go unchallenged.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying you can capture\Nbigger game than I can,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like my hunting skills are inferior?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Challenge accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, winner brings back\Nthe most pounds of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean pounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.81,0:14:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'll bring back tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you let your hunting\Ndo your talking for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.87,0:14:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.63,0:14:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do those two jerks\Nhave to be so competitive?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.57,0:14:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it makes you feel better, I'm just\Nas stumped by their behavior as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sitting ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I already know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I think of that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.41,0:15:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.05,0:15:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not this one either. Gah!\NGah! Nami! Whoa! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.91,0:15:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you\Nlooking for anyway, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.41,0:15:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember reading about it in a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.53,0:15:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, reading about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.73,0:15:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.47,0:15:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.83,0:15:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shellfish that looks like a squid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.41,0:15:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shell squidfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.19,0:15:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sort of assembles an amminoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.81,0:16:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a feeling someone's\Nbeen following me for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.15,0:16:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.01,0:16:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paulie Yee Koo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're supposed to\Nbe, but I'm guessing you're edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.33,0:16:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see, which one was it? Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.11,0:16:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I read it recently,\Nbut I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.89,0:16:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The title's on the tip of my tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.23,0:17:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a sea king doing on land?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.81,0:17:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.01,0:17:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! This is unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.49,0:17:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.40,0:17:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow this island has been frozen in\Ntime, stuck in the age of the dinosaurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.57,0:17:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Travel in the Grand Line is so difficult,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.73,0:17:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so no species ever migrated\Nbetween the islands,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and their unique\Necosystems were preserved!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.81,0:17:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some of these islands have developed\Nextremely sophisticated cultures,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.57,0:17:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,both biological and sociological,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.05,0:17:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while others remain in a sort\Nof evolutionary stagnation with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.13,0:17:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little to no progression for several\Nthousands or tens of thousands,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this case, it seems,\Neven millions of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.03,0:17:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only assume that\Nit's the random climates
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.71,0:17:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,within the Grand Line\Nthat make this possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what other explanation is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.93,0:18:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're standing on the island\Nthat predates mankind!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.17,0:18:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.43,0:18:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Usopp! Huh? Nami? What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.87,0:18:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, did you find your book yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.29,0:18:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.51,0:18:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.89,0:18:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.85,0:18:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I get the sense that Nami needs me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.05,0:19:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To those who reside here\Nand call this island home,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it must seem as if they have stumbled\Nupon their very own private garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, I have aptly named this wondrous,\Nterrifying place Little Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Louis Arnot, Explorer.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.55,0:19:36.72,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)}Brogy the Giant
Dialogue: 2,0:19:33.55,0:19:36.72,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Brogy the Giant
Dialogue: 3,0:19:33.55,0:19:36.72,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Brogy the Giant
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what is the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.19,0:19:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you repeat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.51,0:19:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked if you had any alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.17,0:19:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I drank mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.47,0:19:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.93,0:19:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, there's just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.63,0:19:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the drinking kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for cooking and disinfecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.63,0:19:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if that's acceptable,\Nyou're welcome to it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.61,0:20:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Brogy, Elbaf's strongest\Nwarrior, invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.41,0:20:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I have dinner, and the two\Nof you are invited as my guests!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.87,0:20:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.99,0:20:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just pretend you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.31,0:20:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\Ndon't move a muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That plain dad only fools bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.65,0:20:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:20:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.23,0:21:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an amazing view!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.09,0:21:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the perfect spot for our lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.59,0:21:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't here to have a picnic, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.79,0:21:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to keep moving. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.83,0:21:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they have active volcanoes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.77,0:21:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only that, look, there's a\Nmountain with huge holes in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.69,0:21:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come down already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me know! This is awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been eating the lawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it got dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.97,0:21:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.88,0:21:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.49,0:21:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.39,0:22:31.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,735)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(433,475,\1a&H00&)\t(5855,5897,\1a&HFF&)}Dorry the Giant
Dialogue: 2,0:22:25.39,0:22:31.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,735)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(433,475,\1a&H00&)\t(5855,5897,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Dorry the Giant
Dialogue: 3,0:22:25.39,0:22:31.98,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,735)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Dorry the Giant
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.25,0:22:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.16,0:22:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was glorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.35,0:22:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watching the likes of you\Ngrapple with longnecks
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.49,0:22:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the most entertainment\NI've had in quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my first visitor in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.41,0:22:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you are huge! Are you human?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.49,0:22:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greatest warrior of all Elba!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.39,0:22:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.66,0:22:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.61,0:22:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that they exist, but\NI've never actually seen one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.29,0:22:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hi, I'm Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.77,0:22:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.51,0:23:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, good for you, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.55,0:23:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah, gah,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.11,0:23:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gah,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.31,0:23:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gah,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.40,0:23:25.53,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)}Home of Brogy the Giant
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.40,0:23:25.53,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Home of Brogy the Giant
Dialogue: 3,0:23:20.40,0:23:25.53,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Home of Brogy the Giant
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.22,0:23:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gah, gah, gah,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.14,0:23:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gah, gah, gah, gah, gah,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gah, gah,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.53,0:23:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,g
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.07,0:23:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, eat hearty, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.47,0:23:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It tastes delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.61,0:23:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I've lost my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.31,0:23:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy now. Dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.23,0:23:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't want to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.63,0:23:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.31,0:24:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dinosaur meat is sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.79,0:24:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you it's quite tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.39,0:24:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess he's attempting to\Nfatten us up before he kills us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.09,0:24:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be plump and juicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.89,0:24:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought he'd end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.83,0:24:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a typical barbaric giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.35,0:24:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're too young to die. Too young.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.23,0:24:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's the appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.33,0:24:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.43,0:24:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.47,0:24:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what a\Nscrumptious meal you're missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.07,0:24:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't eat until the log resets.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.43,0:24:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can keep our hunger and\Nwaistlines in check, we might survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.89,0:24:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't know how much\Nlonger I can hold out, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.93,0:24:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't eat something pretty soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.71,0:24:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I'll have the strength\Nor willpower to resist his offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.67,0:24:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loggy, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.07,0:24:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.29,0:24:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's on your mind, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.17,0:24:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, how long will it take to\Nreset the log on this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.59,0:24:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One full year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.81,0:24:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A year?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.27,0:25:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we waited that long to eat, we\Nwouldn't have stomachs to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.07,0:25:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.98,0:25:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.99,0:25:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're\Ngonna fall asleep again.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:18.39,0:25:23.35,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,976)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(439,481,\1a&H00&)\t(3984,4026,\1a&HFF&)}Home of Dorry the Giant
Dialogue: 2,0:25:18.39,0:25:23.35,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,976)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(439,481,\1a&H00&)\t(3984,4026,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Home of Dorry the Giant
Dialogue: 3,0:25:18.39,0:25:23.35,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,976)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Home of Dorry the Giant
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.63,0:25:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure know how to cook, Giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.55,0:25:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, thanks for the compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.31,0:25:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your pirate goodies are\Nexcellent too, my little friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.51,0:25:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,although the portions are a little small.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.83,0:25:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.45,0:25:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the chef on my ship made it especially\Nfor this trip, so I'm glad you liked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.83,0:25:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because otherwise I'd have to beat you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.48,0:25:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that a threat, shorty? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.41,0:25:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like you, little pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.19,0:25:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.51,0:25:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're becoming fast friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.35,0:25:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to pry, but why do you\Nchoose to live out here all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.11,0:25:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a village to call home?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.57,0:25:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came from a village, a place\Nof many warriors, called Elbaph.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.65,0:26:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It once was home, but I\Nno longer call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.31,0:26:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.22,0:26:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are certain rules in\NElbath which must be obeyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.53,0:26:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what kind of rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.83,0:26:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, if a fight breaks\Nout and neither side yields,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.77,0:26:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,judgment is handed down by Elbath's god.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.81,0:26:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever he deems to be\Nrighteous will be declared
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.07,0:26:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the winner and granted\Nsurvival as well as divine
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.85,0:26:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,protection so Elbeth's\NGod decides that doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.75,0:26:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seem fair fair or not all\Nthat matters is this is
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.53,0:26:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our battleground as on\NElbeth, our God will decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.69,0:26:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who was righteous and\Nworthy of winning both the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.83,0:26:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,duel and his life yeah yeah\Nyeah yeah we fought for
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.71,0:26:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a century but Elbeth has\Nyet to choose a Champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.39,0:26:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys have been fighting\Nfor more than a hundred years?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.03,0:26:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From a human's point of view, 100\Nyears may seem like a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.31,0:26:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it isn't considering a giant's\Naverage lifespan is three times yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.33,0:26:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with all the time in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.77,0:26:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think your desire would wane after\Na hundred years of the same battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.15,0:26:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, is there any\Nreal animosity left between you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.19,0:26:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or are you just fighting to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.17,0:27:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's some explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.27,0:27:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, it's time to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.33,0:27:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that? An eruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.61,0:27:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.05,0:27:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.87,0:27:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.05,0:27:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, but there\Nis something I must attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.05,0:27:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? You're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.27,0:27:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.89,0:27:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the signal my opponent and I\Nused to mark the beginning of our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.99,0:27:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fight? With who? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.89,0:27:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And more importantly, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.19,0:27:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.10,0:27:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.65,0:28:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And before we realized,\Nit became our routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.31,0:28:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That volcano is our marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.27,0:28:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever it erupts, we begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.85,0:28:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's senseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.15,0:28:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you have so much hatred for\Nsomeone that you'd fight them for a century?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.25,0:28:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could have happened\Nto make you this mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.33,0:28:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.24,0:28:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what this is about, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.57,0:28:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.59,0:28:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is about honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.81,0:28:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have forgotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.55,0:28:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason for our brawl!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.61,0:29:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The odds that you'll\Nfind it are slim to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.51,0:29:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world's such a big\Nplace, the oceans are wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.85,0:29:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomocopo won't help you find it,\Njust give up, it's astronomical.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.05,0:29:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've been so!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.07,0:29:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone tries to\Nkeep us from moving on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.17,0:29:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The factor behind our\Nback just keeps us strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.49,0:29:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad cause we're still\Nselling for what's so fun for y 'all?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.49,0:29:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.25,0:29:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be for this\Nchasing impossible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.11,0:29:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've just gotta try.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.57,0:29:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crazier the dream The\Nmore ambition I'm gonna need.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.19,0:29:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be for this driving home But\NI know that I've just gotta fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.83,0:29:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll follow the sea The greater\Nparadise We're gonna fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.31,0:30:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, just keep up crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.31,0:30:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you say that you're closer to
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.19,0:30:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The horizon of your dreams?

